url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Trump 2025 - Resuming The National Nightmare Of Peace And Prosperity (Part 2)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trump-2025-resuming-the-national-nightmare-of-peace-and-prosperity-part-2/292596","site":"T Nation · 5091 posts · 2025"},{"title":"The Return of Even More Movies You've Watched This Week III","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-return-of-even-more-movies-youve-watched-this-week-iii/210398","site":"T Nation · 4744 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Have You Ever Beta Orbited a Girl","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/have-you-ever-beta-orbited-a-girl/248693","site":"T Nation · 3018 posts · 2018"},{"title":"Religion Catch All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/religion-catch-all/268570","site":"T Nation · 2730 posts · 2020"},{"title":"TnT's Forward Momentum!","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tnts-forward-momentum/247675","site":"T Nation · 2398 posts · 2018"},{"title":"What Are You Reading?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/what-are-you-reading/267743","site":"T Nation · 1942 posts · 2020"},{"title":":fire: Post Your Hot Takes... Even the Oddly Specific Ones","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/post-your-hot-takes-even-the-oddly-specific-ones/283831","site":"T Nation · 1913 posts · 2023"},{"title":"The War on Drugs","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-war-on-drugs/265165","site":"T Nation · 1909 posts · 2020"},{"title":"A Completely Random Thread of Randomness","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/a-completely-random-thread-of-randomness/288471","site":"T Nation · 1569 posts · 2024"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"Long Covid Might Be the Manifestation of a Different Virus Reawakened in Body","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=28230086","site":"Hacker News","score":10,"comments":0,"year":2021},{"title":"We Look Like Our Names: Manifestation of Name Stereotypes in Facial Appearance [pdf]","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=38743916","site":"Hacker News","score":3,"comments":0,"year":2023},{"title":"We Look Like Our Names: Manifestation of Name Stereotypes in Faces (2017) [PDF]","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32116841","site":"Hacker News","score":3,"comments":0,"year":2022}],"web":[{"title":"Law of attraction (New Thought)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_attraction_(New_Thought)"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Confidence & presence","chain":["Visualise the desired look","Feel the goal as already achieved","Believed to attract the change"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Practitioners combine visualisation and affirmations in the belief that thoughts draw matching outcomes, applying it to a changed face, body or skin and a more confident feeling along the way. No studies test manifestation for physical appearance change."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Manifestation, in this context, is the application of the law of attraction, the New Thought belief that thoughts and feelings draw matching experiences into a person's life, to appearance goals such as a changed face, body or skin.[1] Practitioners typically combine visualisation and affirmations, and stress feeling that the goal has already been achieved.[1]","Wikipedia reports that no empirical scientific evidence supports the law of attraction, and that it is widely regarded as pseudoscience or religion framed in scientific language.[1] Proponents counter with personal accounts of success. No studies have tested manifestation specifically for physical appearance."],"infobox":[["Type","Belief / mental practice"],["Tradition","New Thought"],["Popularised","The Secret (2006)"],["Related practices","Visualisation, affirmations"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["The law of attraction holds that positive or negative thoughts attract matching outcomes, that thoughts and people are made of energy, and that like energy attracts like.[1] Advocates pair reframing of negative thinking with affirmations and visualisation, and recommend feeling the goal is already achieved.[1] 'Manifestation' became a modern rebrand of the idea, and 'lucky girl syndrome' went viral on TikTok in the early 2020s.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"History","paras":["The idea grew from the New Thought movement, with Phineas Quimby often regarded as a starting point; historian Mitch Horowitz traces the term to 1855, and Prentice Mulford described it as a principle in 1886 to 1887.[1] Napoleon Hill's Think and Grow Rich (1937), Norman Vincent Peale's The Power of Positive Thinking (1952) and Louise Hay's You Can Heal Your Life (1984) spread related ideas.[1] Rhonda Byrne's film and book The Secret (2006) brought it to mass audiences.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Research and expert views","paras":["Wikipedia reports that evidence for the law of attraction is largely anecdotal, that claims are hard to test, and that selection and confirmation bias can distort reports.[1] Physicists Victor Stenger and Leon Lederman rejected the use of quantum mysticism to explain it, and skeptics such as Mary Carmichael and Ben Radford argued that The Secret lacks scientific basis and can imply blame for misfortune.[1] A 2023 study reported that believers often report higher success but also take more financial risk and are more susceptible to bankruptcy.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Use in looksmaxxing","paras":["Within appearance-focused communities, manifestation is generally discussed at the fringe, as visualising a changed face or body. Because published sources reviewed contain no studies of it, its effect on appearance is untested."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. Related research on self-affirmation is described in a separate entry."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1855","event":"Earliest traced use of the term, per Mitch Horowitz.[1]"},{"year":"1937","event":"Napoleon Hill publishes Think and Grow Rich.[1]"},{"year":"2006","event":"Rhonda Byrne's The Secret released.[1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Law of attraction (New Thought)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Law_of_attraction_(New_Thought)","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Manifestation is what ascends foids and descends people on org","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/manifestation-is-what-ascends-foids-and-descends-people-on-org.1613408/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250924123341/https://looksmax.org/threads/manifestation-is-what-ascends-foids-and-descends-people-on-org.1613408/"},{"title":"Indepth Manifesting guide! Achieve what you want with the power of your mind!","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/indepth-manifesting-guide-achieve-what-you-want-with-the-power-of-your-mind.1033867/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240515221908/https://looksmax.org/threads/indepth-manifesting-guide-achieve-what-you-want-with-the-power-of-your-mind.1033867/"},{"title":"I will dedicate one hour a day to law of attraction","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-will-dedicate-one-hour-a-day-to-law-of-attraction.945761/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240316202344/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-will-dedicate-one-hour-a-day-to-law-of-attraction.945761/"},{"title":"i have a method of manifestation that just might work i know yall dont believe in this but just listen","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-have-a-method-of-manifestation-that-just-might-work-i-know-yall-dont-believe-in-this-but-just-listen.937924/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240316172720/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-have-a-method-of-manifestation-that-just-might-work-i-know-yall-dont-believe-in-this-but-just-listen.937924/"},{"title":"Simo - The Red Shoe Diaries (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/simo-the-red-shoe-diaries-part-1/228734","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Trump 2025 - Resuming The National Nightmare Of Peace And Prosperity (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trump-2025